BT 1 0 0 1 0 57.5 Tm 11 TL /F2 8.5 Tf .266667 .266667 .266667 rg (Group channels) Tj /F1 8.5 Tf ( \(1-9, 12-13\): press the group button for that pair \(1-2, 3-4, 5-6 or 7-8\) plus L/R to hear it. Pan picks the group, so keep) Tj T* (these settings fixed. If they sound lopsided in the headphones, press MONO or use the AUX SEND 3/4 performer mix; neither changes the) Tj T* (recording. ) Tj /F2 8.5 Tf (Direct-out channels) Tj /F1 8.5 Tf ( \(10-11, 14-18, 21\): pan doesn't affect what's recorded, so set it for the headphones. Press L/R only, no) Tj T* (group buttons. The direct out is after the EQ, fader and mute: keep faders near U \(unity\) and don't mute while recording. ) Tj /F2 8.5 Tf (Monitor-only) Tj T* (channels) Tj /F1 8.5 Tf ( \(19-20 and 23-24\): press L/R only; they aren't recorded through the console. ) Tj /F2 8.5 Tf (Other layouts:) Tj /F1 8.5 Tf ( an all-direct-outs version of this map) Tj T* (\(every channel 1-16 on its own track, no groups\) is in the Alternate Setups chapter, with how to switch.) Tj T* ET
